["pañcasthāvāyava pañca manobindustathaiva ca", "jālaṃdharaṃ kāmarūpaṃ pūrṇagiri śrīhastakaḥ", "nadānadyaḥ samudrāśca bhuvanāni caturdaśaḥ", "teṣāṃ saṃkṣepataḥ sādhyaṃ pravadanti śuvismṛte", "aharniśaṃ tuṣārābhaṃ śudhāṃ varṣatyadho mukhaṃ", "taralastu śudhājñeyā ghanobiṃdurudāhṛtaḥ", "biṃduvargasya sādhyena dehasiddhiḥ prajāyate", "madhyamāmūlasaṃvyāpya sūryan tiṣṭhati dehināṃ", "sarveṣāṃ dehināṃ tiṣthet annādiḥ pāvakaḥ sadā", "tatsaṃyoge sthitaḥ prāṇaḥ viyogātmaraṇaṃ bhavet", "abhyāsāt kāmarūpena yogaṃ yoga vidoviduḥ", "arogī ca bhave devī prāṇāpānaika yogataḥ", "anayoḥ saṃgamaṃ sadhyaṃ rajobījasya sādhanaṃ", "samānāpānayoryogaḥ prāṇāpānekayogataḥ", "nābhiśaktiḥ dvayormadhye oḍḍiyānaṃ taducyate", "pūrṇagiriḥ hṛdirmadhye śrīhadvaṃ tālukopari", "navadvārāṇi saṃyamya kukṣimāpūrya vāyunā", "vaṃhneḥ pradīpanātnityaṃ annādeḥ pācanaṃ bhavet", "svabhāvādbīja evāsau biṃduvibhartinānyadhā", "vāyureva paro dehe mūlasāraḥ prakīrtitaḥ", "hṛdiḥ prāṇo guḍa'pānaḥ samāno nābhisaṃsthitaḥ", "sthānavāyuñca saṃkṣipya vasthideśe punaḥ punaḥ", "brahmagranthiṃ tatotitvā vāyurviśati madhyamāṃ", "maṇipūraṃ nābhideśe tato vidhyātsadā gatiḥ", "tālumūlaṃ sudhācakre bhitvārudrālayaṃ vrajet", "vāyunā sahayogeṇa bindu tatraiva gacchati", "śaṃkhinī nālasaṃprāpya cāsthi śūnyaṃ vibhartisaḥ", "evaṃ mabhyāsayogeṇa naro brahmani yaḥ sthitaḥ", "māse māse'śvamedhaśca yajñasya ca phalaṃ bhavet", "dahyate sarvapāpāni koṭijanmārjitāni ca", "tapāṃsi yoni kathyaṃte yajñadānavratāni ca", "nandanti pitaraḥ sarve putro yogānusāriṇī", "yallabdhvā yoginaḥ sarve mucyate janma baṃdhanāt", "śirasi śaṅkaro jñeyā tristhānaṃ muktidaṃ smṛtaṃ", "jyotipuñja ca cakravat hṛdimadhye ca tiṣṭhati", "dhyāyet mūddhni śivajyoti ghṛtapiṇḍasivoddhṛtaṃ", "melakaṃ vāyubiṃdūbhyāṃ kartavyaṃ manasā budhaiḥ", "tathācakreṣu sarveṣu pratyaṃ jyotiḥ pradṛśyate", "jyotiṣi trīṇi tatraiva teṣu cātmā pratiṣṭhati", "tatraiva cāsthi śūnye tu kālacāraḥ palāyate", "jyoṭiṣāṃ vāyu biṃdurnāmelakaṃ muktidāyakaṃ", "vāyurbindu manaścātmā tasya sarvasthiraṃ bhavet", "calate calamānosau mṛtyumabhyeti śāśvata", "dhyānātītaṃ paraṃ brahma sarvaśāstreṣu gopitaṃ", "ādhāro bhuvanānāñca dehasthā dehavarjitāḥ", "janma vṛddhyādi rahita ātmāsarvagatānyayaḥ", "anitya khaṇḍayet sarvaṃ yatkiñcit manasārjitaṃ", "karaṇāni manaścaiva yadā brahmaṇi nīyate", "animādi guṇāstasya * * * * * * * *?", "tadūrddhañca paraṃ viṣṇoḥ hṛdaye ca guṇānvitaṃ", "tadūrddhañca mahāśūnyaṃ yatra brahma yathāśramaṃ", "kālasya rakṣayaṃ jñātvā svayaṃ brahma samo bhavet", "pratyadde jñānacintāyāṃ na kiñcidanyathā bhavet", "siddhāḥ siddhaṃ prakurvanti te yānti paramā gatiḥ", "evaṃ yogasamāsādhya gacchantiṃ paramāṃ gati", "asatyarnocatā krūrāḥ dvijavedaviniṃdakāḥ", "ālasau pīḍitā ye ca kāmakrodhaprapīḍitā", "tena mukti padaṃ yāti dharme nānena pārvatai", "kecit dhyānaṃ yugaṃsaṃti vijñānañca paraḥ paraṃ", "sādhyaḥ cānu kramaṃ kṛtvā te yānti paramāṃ gatiṃ", "sarvapāpakṣayaṃ tasya brahmaṇasadanaṃ bhajet", "dinekanāśvamedhānāṃ yajñānāñca phalaṃ labhet", "ataḥ puṇyataraṃ śāstraṃ nocātra vidyate kvacit"]